    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12720" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποκά̆θᾰρ-σις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>purging</i>: hence, of <i>dross,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				383b4
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				4.2.1
			</span></i>; of animal <i>secretions,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				726a13
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>HA</u>
